kGene 20/10/96 v1.07
------------------

Put the following files into the required directories (on any drive):

GENE.OPA       \APP
GENEREP.OPA    \APP
GENEGED.OPA    \APP

This file must be on internal drive:

KGENE.RSC      \GENE     (May need to create if first install)

Install GENE.OPA as normal (Psion-I).

When you run the program it will create the following files (on internal):

\GENE\GPERSON.ODB
\GENE\GMARRY.ODB
\GENE\GCHILD.ODB
\GENE\GNOTES.ODB
\GENE\GPREFS.CFG

GROVES.GED is a copy of the GEDCOM file I used for testing.

TEST.GED is a straight GEDCOM export of GROVES.GED which was used
to check GEDCOM.

Don't forget there may be bugs (espec around update/delete) so do make 
regular backups in case there is a problem.

There is some help but not much yet.

Let me know how things go and I will sort out any bugs/ideas ready for
the next release.

Latest updates and support in the kSoft conf on CIX.

